@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "用户" as User
participant "Voime" as App
participant "麦克风" as Mic
participant "终端" as Term
participant "剪贴板" as Clip

User -> App : 按 Space
App -> Term : 显示红色标记与新行
App -> Mic : 开始本段采集
loop 采集期间
  Mic -> App : PCM 帧
  App -> Term : 更新临时文本
end
User -> App : 再按 Space / 静音自动结束
App -> Mic : 结束本段采集
App -> Term : 隐藏标记
App -> App : 内部处理\n最终识别与标点
App -> Term : 固化结果行
App -> Clip : 写入会话文本
@enduml
